	"Food from the forest floor - but a bad one poisons the gatherer until the tribe learns which are safe (or a Lore 2+ gatherer picks).": "林地里的食物——但在部落学会分辨之前，毒蘑菇会让采集者中毒（学识 2 级以上的人采摘则无妨）。",
	"Slow to dig, but they keep in the ground: food even in winter.": "挖起来慢，但埋在地下不会坏：冬天也有吃的。",
	"Seed-heads of wild grass. Gathering them teaches farming twice as fast.": "野草的穗子。采集它们能让部落加倍快地领悟农耕。",
	"Sweet food that lifts the spirit (+devotion). The bees sting - unless Friction Fire is known to smoke them out.": "甜美的食物，令人振奋（虔诚 +）。蜜蜂会蜇人——除非已掌握钻木取火，用烟把它们熏走。",
	"Fish in the river shallows: plenty and quick to return - but none while the river is iced over in winter.": "河浅处的鱼：数量多、回得快——但冬天河面结冰时就捕不到了。",
	"Willow-bark tea breaks a fever: the sick recover 2.5x faster while the tribe has herbs.": "柳树皮茶能退烧：只要部落有草药，病人康复快 2.5 倍。",
	"Yarrow staunches wounds: the hurt heal twice as fast at the village while the tribe has herbs.": "蓍草能止血：只要部落有草药，伤者在村里痊愈快一倍。",
	"Sharp stone that can be worked by hand (no tools needed). Finding it brings Polished Stone Tools much closer.": "能徒手打制的锋利石头（无需工具）。找到它能让部落离磨制石器更近一大步。",
	"Green-streaked rock. With tin, it makes bronze.": "带绿色纹路的岩石。与锡一起可以炼出青铜。",
	"Heavy dark stones, rare and far. Bronze cannot be made without it.": "沉重的黑色石头，稀少而遥远。没有它就炼不出青铜。",
	"Red earth for painting bodies, walls and the dead: each load is lore, and the tribe grows more spiritual.": "用来涂抹身体、墙壁和逝者的红土：每背回一筐都化为学识，部落也更加崇尚灵性。",
	"Salt to cure meat: once found, the stores spoil half as fast.": "用来腌肉的盐：一旦找到，存粮腐坏的速度减半。",
