	"Houses 3 people. At night 3 sleep inside, warm and safe from wolves.": "可住 3 人。夜里 3 人睡在里面，暖和又不怕狼。",
	"Houses 5 people, and 5 can sleep inside at night.": "可住 5 人，夜里能睡 5 人。",
	"A ring of stakes: people inside it get +3 DEF. Floods can't wash it away.": "一圈木桩：圈内的人防御 +3。洪水冲不垮它。",
	"Steady food from the river (less in winter).": "从河里稳定获得食物（冬天减少）。",
	"Warmth: nobody near it freezes, the sick heal faster, and those who don't fit in huts sleep around it. Lights up the land around it.": "温暖：靠近它的人不会冻伤，病人好得更快，住不进小屋的人围着它睡。照亮周围的土地。",
	"People near it fight with +20% ATK.": "附近的人作战攻击 +20%。",
	"A trickle of lore. Rituals near it give 50% more lore, and the sick nearby heal faster.": "缓缓产生学识。在它附近举行仪式多得 50% 学识，附近的病人好得更快。",
	"Steady food from the field (none in winter, less in drought).": "从田里稳定获得食物（冬天没有，旱季减少）。",
	"Houses 4 people (and they sleep here). Gatherers drop food here, so build it near the fields.": "可住 4 人（夜里也睡在这里）。采集者会把食物送到这里，所以最好建在田地附近。",
	"Summons Yinglong the winged dragon to guard the village. Rituals and healing as a shrine. Needed for Victory by Wisdom.": "召唤应龙守护村庄。兼有神龛的仪式与疗愈之效。智慧胜利所必需。",
	"Home to up to 2 pack oxen. Each ox eats food and needs tending, and lets one gatherer carry 50% more.": "最多养 2 头驮牛。每头牛都要吃粮、要照料，并能让一名采集者多背 50%。",
	"Arms the tribe in bronze (+60% ATK, +3 DEF) while it has copper and tin; it uses one of each per day.": "有铜和锡时，让部落以青铜武装（攻击 +60%，防御 +3）；每天各消耗一份。",
	"A trickle of lore. Where the chiefs of the clans can meet: needed for Victory by Unity.": "缓缓产生学识。各部落首领在此议事：团结胜利所必需。",
