	"Lightning strikes %s - and they live! The sky has touched them.": "闪电击中了%s——而他们活了下来！上天触碰过他们。",
	"was struck by lightning on Day %d and lived - touched by the sky": "被闪电击中却活了下来，受过上天的触碰（第%d天）",
	"Fire from the sky! %s carries a burning branch home. The tribe has seen how fire lives.": "天降之火！%s把一根燃烧的树枝带回了家。部落亲眼见到了火是如何存活的。",
	"carried fire from a lightning-struck tree on Day %d": "从被雷劈中的树上取回了火种（第%d天）",
