	"The Sun Is Devoured": "天狗食日",
	"At midday a black mouth eats the sun. Birds fall silent, the air turns cold, and stars come out in the day. The people cry out and look to you.": "正午时分，一张黑色的大口吞下了太阳。鸟儿噤声，空气变冷，白昼里竟出现了星星。众人惊呼，望向你。",
	"Beat the drums": "击鼓驱兽",
	"Drive off the sky-beast with drums and shouting. (+devotion, the tribe grows more martial)": "用鼓声和呐喊赶走天上的野兽。（虔诚 +，部落更尚武）",
