	"Let %s read the omen": "让%s解读征兆",
	"Only a wise shaman (Lore 3+) or the knowledge of the Megalithic Totems can calm the people - otherwise they panic.": "只有睿智的巫师（学识 3 级以上）或巨石图腾的知识能安抚众人——否则人们会陷入恐慌。",
	"beat the drums to drive the sky-beast from the sun on Day %d": "击鼓把天上的野兽从太阳边赶走（第%d天）",
	"The drums thunder and the people howl at the sky. Slowly, the beast spits out the sun.": "鼓声如雷，众人朝天嘶吼。渐渐地，那野兽把太阳吐了出来。",
	"offered food to the devoured sun on Day %d": "向被吞噬的太阳献上食物（第%d天）",
	"The offering burns on the fire. The sky is fed, and gives the sun back.": "祭品在火中燃烧。上天吃饱了，把太阳还了回来。",
	"read the omen of the devoured sun and calmed the tribe on Day %d": "解读了太阳被吞的征兆，安抚了部落（第%d天）",
	"%s points to the old marks on the totems: \"The sun has been eaten before, and always it returns.\" The people grow calm, and learn.": "%s指着图腾上古老的刻痕：“太阳从前也被吞过，而它总会回来。”众人平静下来，也学到了东西。",
	"hid in terror when the sun was devoured on Day %d": "太阳被吞时惊恐地躲了起来（第%d天）",
	"%s has no answer. Panic! The people drop their work and hide in their huts until the light returns.": "%s答不上来。恐慌！众人丢下手中的活，躲进小屋，直到光明重现。",
