	"Spring returns. The berries ripen again.": "春天回来了，浆果又成熟了。",
	"Summer. Watch the food stores - they spoil faster in the heat.": "夏天到了。留意存粮——天热时食物坏得更快。",
	"Autumn. Winter comes in two days: gather food and wood, and keep the fires lit.": "秋天到了。两天后入冬：赶紧囤积食物和木材，让篝火一直烧着。",
