	"The drought breaks.": "干旱结束了。",
	"The sky turns white-grey - a blizzard is coming! Get everyone to the fires.": "天空变成灰白色——暴风雪要来了！让所有人回到篝火边。",
	"Blizzard! Anyone far from a fire will freeze.": "暴风雪！远离火堆的人会被冻僵。",
	"Drought: berries wither and the fields go dry.": "干旱：浆果枯萎，田地干涸。",
