	"%sAt last! The %s have grown fat and proud. Give me %d spears, we dance, we strike, and %s!": "%s终于！%s已经又肥又骄。给我%d支长矛，我们跳战舞，我们出击，然后%s！",
	"%sIf it must be the %s, we do it carefully: we watch their village first, strike with %d of us, %s, and come home before they gather. We stop if blood runs too freely.": "%s如果非打%s不可，我们就小心行事：先窥探他们的村落，%d人出击，%s，在他们集结之前回家。血流得太多我们就收手。",
	"%sThe spirits demand it. We dance for the ancestors, then %d of us fall upon the %s and %s.": "%s神灵要求如此。我们为祖先起舞，然后%d人扑向%s，%s。",
	"%sThe %s's stores would fill our bellies through winter. %d of us, quick and quiet - %s.": "%s%s的存粮够我们吃过整个冬天。%d个人，又快又静——%s。",
	"%sA long walk to the %s... fine. %d of us, %s, and home again.": "%s去%s要走好远……好吧。%d个人，%s，然后回家。",
	"They fight like cornered bears, Chieftain! Half our spears are down - but %s still stand. One more push!": "他们像困兽一样拼命，首领！我们倒下了一半——但%s还站着。再冲一次！",
	"Chieftain, half our war party is down. %s still hold the village. We should not throw away the rest.": "首领，我们的战团倒下了一半。%s还守着村子。剩下的人不该白白送死。",
	"Chieftain, we have lost half our war party! %s still stand against us.": "首领，我们损失了一半战团！%s还在抵抗。",
